[00:00.302]Legends never die when the world is callin' you
{"当世界呼唤你的名字时 传奇永不消逝"}
[00:06.214]Can you hear them screaming out your name?
{"你可听见他们正高呼你的姓名？"}
[00:12.200]Legends never die
{"传奇永不消逝"}
[00:16.162]They never lose hope when everything's cold
{"当万物冰封时 他们依然怀抱希望"}
[00:19.165]And the fighting's near
{"当战火迫近时"}
[00:22.285]It's deep in their bones
{"这信念已刻入骨髓"}
[00:23.885]They run into smoke when the fire is fierce
{"当烈焰肆虐时 他们偏要逆火前行"}
[00:27.934]Oh, pick yourself up 'cause
{"快振作起来吧 因为"}
[00:30.882]
