[00:59.053]They're written down in eternity
{"他们的名字将永载史册"}
[01:02.019]But you'll never see the price it costs – the scars collected all their lives
{"但你永远看不见代价几何——那些毕生累积的伤痕"}
[01:11.841]When everything's lost, they pick up their hearts and avenge defeat
{"当失去一切时 他们重拾初心 复仇雪耻"}
